# Docker build context for deploy/Dockerfile. The builder compiles from source inside the image, so
# the context only needs the cargo workspace, the packs the ctl stage bakes in, and tools/.
# Everything below is a build output or an editor/VCS artefact that no image stage reads. Keeping
# them out matters: runinator-command-center/node_modules alone is ~150MB that would otherwise be
# hashed and shipped on every one of the per-target builds.
#
# Note that runinator-command-center/src-tauri is NOT excluded: it is a cargo workspace member, so
# its manifest has to be present for the workspace to resolve even though no stage builds it.

# build outputs
**/target
**/dist
**/node_modules

# VCS and local tooling
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea
.claude
.clj-kondo
.lsp
**/.DS_Store

# local runtime state
.runinator-supervisor
